level0	1910	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	As Emily sat in the diner, she noticed a man staring at her. He was tall and muscular, with a scar on his cheek. Emily felt a shiver run down her spine; she didn't like the way he was looking at her. She finished her coffee and quickly left the diner, not wanting to stay in the same room as the man. 
