level0	1922	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	Emily dug deeper and found out that Thomas had been a loner, with no family or friends. She also discovered that he had been living in a remote cabin in the woods, not far from where she had been attacked. Emily knew what she had to do. She waited until nightfall and sneaked out of the safe house. She stole a car and drove to the woods, determined to find the killer's lair. 
level0	1928	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	Emily started the car and followed the directions on the map. The rain was still pouring down, and the roads were slippery, but she drove carefully, hoping to avoid any accidents. As she drove, she thought about what had happened to her in the woods. Who was the man who had attacked her? What was the creature in the basement? Emily knew that she would never forget this night. 
