level0	2245	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	"Emily drove the girl to the police station and told them everything that had happened. They took the girl into protective custody and started an immediate search for the killer. Emily knew that they had to find him before he killed anyone else. Over the next few days, Emily worked closely with the police, providing them with any information that she could find about the killer. She spent countless hours researching and investigating, determined to bring him to justice. One night, as Emily was working late at the police station, she received a call from an unknown number. She hesitated before answering, but curiosity got the best of her. ""Hello?"" she said. There was a brief pause before a low, menacing voice spoke. ""You shouldn't have interfered, Emily. You're going to regret it."" Emily's heart raced as she realized that the killer had found her. She knew that she was in danger, but she refused to back down. ""You're not going to scare me,"" she said. ""I'm going to make sure that you pay for what you've done."" "
level0	2252	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	As they drove away, Emily felt a sense of relief wash over her. They had escaped the killer's lair, and they were both safe. But as she looked at the girl in the passenger seat, she knew that there were many others who weren't as lucky. Emily made a vow to herself that she would do everything in her power to bring the killer to justice. She would make sure that no one else suffered the same fate as the girl in the woods. 
