level0	2326	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	"Emily struggled against the man's grip, but he was too strong. He pushed her against the wall and held a knife to her throat. ""I saw you in the woods,"" he said. ""You're not safe here."" Emily's heart raced as she tried to think of a way to escape. She knew she couldn't overpower the man, but maybe she could outsmart him. ""Please,"" she pleaded. ""I don't know what you're talking about. Let me go."" The man hesitated for a moment, and Emily saw a flicker of doubt in his eyes. She seized the opportunity and kicked him in the groin. He doubled over in pain, and she ran out of the alleyway as fast as she could. "
level0	2335	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	The police arrived, and Emily told them everything that had happened to her. They took her statement and promised to investigate. They also told her that there had been a string of disappearances in the town recently, and that they suspected a serial killer was on the loose. Emily couldn't believe her ears. She had stumbled into a town where a killer was lurking, and she had narrowly escaped his grasp. She shuddered to think what might have happened if she hadn't fought back. 
