level0	2531	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	Emily hesitated for a moment but decided to pull over. She rolled down her window and asked the man if he needed any help. He didn't say anything and just stared at her with his dark, soulless eyes. Emily's heart started racing as she realized that something wasn't right. Suddenly, the man lunged towards her, and Emily screamed as she tried to drive away. But it was too late; the man had already grabbed onto her car, and she couldn't shake him off. 
