level0	2555	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	Years later, Emily would still wake up in the middle of the night, covered in sweat, reliving the events of that fateful night. But she also knew that she had done something important. She had helped bring a killer to justice, and she had saved the life of a young girl. And that was something that she could be proud of.
