level0	2566	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	Emily decided to do some investigating of her own. She went online and searched for any information she could find about the disappearances in the town. She found a local newspaper article that mentioned a man named Thomas, who had been missing for over a month. Emily's heart raced as she read the article; the man in the woods had introduced himself as Thomas. 
level0	2567	MonoBehaviour			9630121984	m_Text	QUIT
level0	2573	MonoBehaviour			20887633920	level1atext	Emily ran through the woods, branches slapping her in the face, twigs and leaves crunching under her feet. She didn't know where she was going, but she knew she had to keep moving. After what felt like hours, she stumbled upon an old abandoned cabin. It was dark and foreboding, but it was better than being out in the open. 
